+# Auditor package instructions
+
+Use ops/audit/auditor_package_template.sh to assemble the artifacts auditors want (HIL bundles, Apalache outputs, rt timing reports, SBOMs, signed evidence).
+
+Example:
+
+export COSIGN_KMS_URI="awskms://alias/aegis-cosign-key"
+export S3_UPLOAD="s3://aegis-audit"
+./ops/audit/auditor_package_template.sh --out /tmp/auditor_bundle.tar.gz \
+  --artifacts /tmp/fleet_run_summary.json,/tmp/formal_summary.json,/tmp/rt_timing_report.json \
+  --cosign-key "$COSIGN_KMS_URI" --s3 "$S3_UPLOAD"
